OL,13,G0350 Witness History
OL,14,     FIn the summer of 1985, an Irish
OL,15,     Fvillage became the focus of a
OL,16,     Fnational phenomenon. Thousands
OL,17,     Ftravelled to Ballinspittle after
OL,18,     Freports that a statue of the
OL,19,     FVirgin Mary was moving.
